    <section class="section3" id="about">
    <div class="container">
    <h2>Our Corporate Profile</h2>
    <div class="corporate">
    <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-5 col-sm-5 col-xs-12">
        <p>Over the past five decades, since our establishment in 1961, Dalal &amp; Broacha Stock Broking Pvt. Ltd. has provided impeccable financial solutions and services to a wide spectrum of customers with varied needs, ranging from equities and mutual funds; to wealth management and depository services. Our value added services include distribution of Mutual Funds, IPOs, and Portfolio Management Services.</p>
        <p>Over these five decades, we have evolved from an execution-focused team to integrated wealth managers. Our priority has been to facilitate corporate growth, by expanding our service portfolio to cater to ever evolving investor needs. We are currently handling over 20,000 clients, spread over retail, NRIs, corporates, banks, mutual funds, and FIIs.</p>
        <p>We are members of the Bombay Stock Exchange and the National Stock Exchange in the Cash and F&amp;O segments. We are also Depository Participants with CDSL.</p>
    <p><b>PHILOSOPHY</b><br />
    For over five decades, we have successfully preserved our core philosophy, and we attribute all our achievements to our founding principles of Long Term Value investing, zero speculation, integrity and transparency in all our dealings.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-7 col-sm-7 col-xs-12"><img class="img-responsive module module-fade-in" src="img/tree.png" />
    <p><b>MILESTONES</b><br />
    Dalal &amp; Broacha has always followed a path of consistent and sustainable growth, adding milestones that realize value for the customer while strengthening our market presence.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 sub-corporate">
    <p>At Dalal &amp; Broacha, we have preserved our core philosophy since our inception almost 50 years ago.<br/>
    It is embodied in the following principles:</p>
    
        <ul>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>AVOIDING ANY KIND OF SPECULATIVE RISK-TAKING</span><hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>ENSURING STEADY GROWTH AT EVERY OPPORTUNITY</span><hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>PROTECTING OUR CLIENTS CAPITAL</span><hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>NURTURING LONG-TERM RELATIONSHIPS</span><hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>LONG-TERM APPROACH TO INVESTMENTS</span><hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>MAINTAINING THE TRUST OF OUR CLIENTS</span>	<hr /></li>
        	<li class="module module-zoom-in"><span>ENSURING ABSOLUTE TRANSPARENCY</span><hr /></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    </div>
    
