    <section class="meet-team">
    <div class="container">
    <h2>Team</h2>
    
    <div class="team">
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>NAILESH DALAL</h4>
    
    <p>Nailesh Dalal comes with 35 years of experience in financial solutions. He has played a leading role in the firm&rsquo;s retail and financial functioning. His strength lies in people management and understanding each individual&rsquo;s needs; be it customers or employees.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Vipul Dalal</h4>
    
    <p>He has been responsible for building strong institutional relationships over the last 30 years for the organisation. The focus on institutional business increased after Vipul architected the approach, and we enjoy a coveted position amongst institutional buyers largely due to his efforts.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Hriday Dalal</h4>
    
    <p>The third generation family member to join the business. He leads the focus on business development as well as heads the firms corporate treasury desk. Hriday has been instrumental in establishing the NRI desk and PMS services for the organisation.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Nilay Dalal</h4>
    
    <p>Second of the third-generation family members attached to the business, has worked on various verticals of the business and now has set his focus on business development and maintaining client relationships.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="clearfix hidden-xs"></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Rohan Dalal</h4>
    
    <p>The youngest family member to join the business, plays an important role in strengthening the firm&rsquo;s research potential.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Milind Karmarkar</h4>
    
    <p>A chartered accountant by profession, Milind joined the firm over 30 years ago. He has played a key role in setting up the organisation&rsquo;s research team. He is currently the Fund Manager of the PMS division.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>
    
    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Bhavesh Doshi</h4>
    
    <p>He has been with Dalal &amp; Broacha for over 25 years and has been responsible for setting up the firm&rsquo;s Fixed Income &amp; Distribution Desk.</p>
    
    <hr />
    </div>
    
    <!--<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
    <h4>Hiren Shah</h4>
    
    <p>He is backed by an experience of 50 years in various fields, ranging from merchant banking to broking. Hiren has been with Dalal &amp; Broacha for the past 25 years and is responsible for managing the human resources, administration and strategic planning.</p>
    
    <hr /></div>-->
