    <section class="section5" id="career">
    <div class="container">
    <h2>A Career With Us</h2>
    
    <div class="career">
    <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-5 col-sm-5 col-xs-12">
    <h4>OUR PEOPLE ARE OUR ASSETS</h4>
    
    <p>At Dalal &amp; Broacha, we strive to nurture the best talent for each role and competency. Being an enterprise driven by ethics and excellence, Dalal &amp; Broacha looks for people who mirror and inculcate these principles in their professional lives. We encourage our employees to think outside the box without compromising on our founding ethics and principles.</p>
    
    <h5><br>Current Openings at Dalal & Broacha</h5>
    <table style="width:100%" border: 3px solid black;>          
      <tr>
        <th></th>
        <th style="text-align: center;">Experience required</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
