            <br/><b>Dear Sir/Madam,</b>
            <br/>
            <br/>This is to once again remind you that as per the regulatory guidelines, it is now mandatory for all the clients (New as well as existing) to provide Valid Name, Valid Address (with correct pin code for Indian address), PAN Number, Email id, Mobile number and Gross Annual Income/ Networth (not older than 12 months) for their trading as well as Demat accounts. <b>Use of common email id and mobile number is permissible for Family members only which includes Self, spouse, dependent parents and dependent children. Family flag is required to be updated as ‘Y’ in all such demat accounts.</b>
            <br/>
            <br/>
            <table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px" text-align = "left">
