            <div>   
                <br style="text-align:justify;">Alternatively, you may provide Networth figure as on dd-mm-yyyy
                <br/><b>Note: NRI clients may provide Indian Income Range</b>
                <br/>
                <br/>If there is any change in your existing Email Id/ Mobile number, you need to submit a modification form. For grouping of family accounts, please submit the family declaration. To update latest income range only, please submit Income Declaration Form.
                All forms can be downloaded from our website under the tab DOWNLOADABLE FORMS
        
                <br/>Link : <a href="https://www.dalal-broacha.com/downloadable_forms.html" style="color:blue" target="_blank"><b>downloadable forms</b></a> 
                <br/>
                <br/>We request you to contact or email from your registered Email ID to your respective Branch/ AP / Dealer/HO or send email on <a href="pranali.pange@dalal-broacha.com " style="color:blue" target="_blank"><u>pranali.pange@dalal-broacha.com</u></a> and update the details by <text style="color:red">30th june, 2022</text>. In absence of mandatory KYC data, the account will get deactivated and the client will be allowed to trade only after Re-KYC. Kindly ignore if already updated.
                <br/>
                <br/><b>NOTE: Email ID: <u>notprovided@notprovided.com</u> and mobile number: 6666666666 is not allowed as the new guidelines.</b>
                <br/>
                <br/>In case of any clarification, please feel free to get in touch with the undersigned.
